200  200 the happy path       total_revenue = 8,461,841.81
400  400 you asked wrongly    Both 'year' and 'quarter' are required.
401  401 who are you          Send an Authorization header: 'Bearer <your key>'.
404  404 no such thing        No data for 2031 Q1.
429  429 slow down            Too many requests. Slow down.
500  500 our fault            Something broke on our side. Not your fault.

The first digit is the whole story:
  2xx  it worked
  4xx  you did something wrong  -> fix the request, do not retry
  5xx  they did something wrong -> retry, carefully
